<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medi-Ject started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medi-Ject started with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Rodman &amp; Renshaw said it initiated coverage with a buy rating of Medi-Ject Corp, which developed hand-held device that injects drugs through the skin without a needle by forming a high pressure stream of liquid.</p>
<p>- Shares of Medi-Ject rose 1/8 to 4-5/8.</p>
<p>	  -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
